.env
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
cache/
eval/outputs/
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose. Unanchored, `data/` also matched tests/data/,
# so B0's two fixtures had to be force-added to get in and every fixture added since
# was silently skipped by `git add -A` - which is exactly how P1's four new fixtures
# nearly failed to reach the branch. Downloaded corpora belong in /data/ and
# eval/outputs/; test fixtures are source, and source is tracked.
/data/
.DS_Store
*.code-workspace